OL,3,GNEWSAPM 'on the fence' in
OL,4,ABirmingham-Manchester debate
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think I love all the cities of
OL,7,FEngland now in my new job," he said,
OL,8,Fadding "I'll sit on the fence on that
OL,9,Fparticular one", before pointing out
OL,10,Fwhere Birmingham was making strides.
